.TH ORO-INTERNAL-RUNTIME-SCHEMES 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:internal/runtime\-schemes \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:internal/runtime\-schemes'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
oro:internal/runtime\-schemes is a JavaScript API module exposed by the Oro Runtime.
.SH REFERENCE
.TP
